# Environment secrets
.env
**/.env
# Phase-7 secrets layout: secrets/live/ (REAL materialized secrets) is gitignored;
# secrets/sample/ stays tracked. Real secrets live in the vault (RULE-SECRETS-VAULT-001).
**/secrets/live/
# Stray project-level secrets dump — real P8/keystores/tokens must NEVER sit at the
# workspace PROJECT level (this is a PUBLIC repo); they belong only in
# source/<repo>/secrets/live/ (private, gitignored) + the vault (RULE-SECRETS-VAULT-001).
# General guard for ANY project — replaces the former per-project one-off
# (kmp-project-template/secrets/) so a new project can't regress. Root cause fixed in
# core/scripts/secrets-pull.sh (now materializes to source/<repo>/, never the project dir).
/*/secrets/


